        "sid": "EZK 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu tshidimu tshisambombo, mu ngondo muisambombo, mu dituku ditanu dia ngondo, hanakadi nshikama mu nsubu muanyi, hakadi bakulu ba Yuda bashikama ku mpala kuanyi, tshianza tshia Mukelenge Yehowa tshiakakuma hamʼbidi hanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu diba adi nakatangila, ekumona! Tshinfuanyi tshiakadiku bu tshinfuanyi tshia muntu, ku tshifuka tshiandi tô ue kuinshi kuakadi tshinfuanyi tshia kahia; ne ku tshifuka tshiandi tô ne ku mutu kuakadi tshinfuanyi tshia dinkenke bu dia tshiamu tshikunze tshinonoke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakolola tshinfuanyi tshia tshianza, wakankuata ku tshisuba tshia nsuki ya ku mutu kuanyi; Nyuma wakambisha mulu hankatshi ha buloba ne diulu, wakaya nʼanyi mu bikena kumona bia Nzambi to ne ku Yelushalema, ku tshibi tshia ku tshibuelelu tshia ku luseke lua node tshidi tshibuela mu tshiendelu tshia munda mua ntempelo, kuakadi luhingu lua mukau, ludi lusonsola mukau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Monai! Butumbi bua Nzambi wa Isalele buakadiku, bu tshinfuanyi atshi tshinakamona diambedi mu mpata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe yeye wakangambila ne, Muana wa muntu, banduluka, tangila ku luseke lua ku node. Ahu nakabanduluka, nakatangila ku luseke lua ku node, ekumona, ku luseke lua ku nôde kua tshibuelelu tshia ku tshioshelu, ku mbelu kuatshi, kuakadi luhingu elu lua mukau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakankonka ne, Muana wa muntu, udi umona bu mudibo benza, anyi? Malu a bundu adi ba mu tshisamba tshia Bena Isalele benza munemu, adi angihata ku nsubu wanyi wa tshijila, udi umona mene, anyi? Kadi neumone malu makuabo a bundu adi ahita â bunene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakalua nʼanyi ku tshibi tshia ku tshiendelu; ne hanakatangila, nakamona disoso mu tshimanu tshia nsubu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe yeye wakangambila ne, Muana wa muntu, utubule disoso mu tshimanu. Hanakatubula disoso mu tshimanu, nakamona tshibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakangambila ne, Buela, umone malu a bundu adibo benzamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku nakabuelamu, nakatangila, ekumona! Bifuanyikishi bionso bia bintu bidi bidikoka hanshi, bia nyama mibiha, ne bia mpingu yonso ya Bena Isalele, biakadi bifunda ku nseke yonso ya bimanu bia nsubu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakulu makumi muanda mutekete ba munkatshi mua bakulu ba Bena Isalele bakadi bimana ku mpala kua mindidimbi ai; ne munkatshi muabo muakadi Yâzanya, muana wa Shafana, muimane. Muntu ne muntu wa munkatshi muabo wakadi mukuate dilonga dia kuoshelamu musenga wa manananshi ku tshianza tshiandi, ne muhuya wa muishi wa ku musenga wa manananshi wakabanda mulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe Yehowa wakangambila ne, Muana wa muntu, udi umona bu mudi bakulu ba mu tshisamba tshia Bena Isalele benza mu mîdima, muntu ne muntu mu nsubu wandi wa mindidimbi, anyi? Bua badi bamba ne, Yehowa kena utumona; Yehowa wakulekela buloba buetu, wakumuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakangambila dî dikuabo ne, Neumone malu makuabo a bundu adibo benza adi ahita â bubi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe wakalua nʼanyi ku tshibi tshia ku tshibuelelu tshia ku nsubu wa Yehowa tshia ku luseke lua nôde; nakamona bakashi bashikameku badila Tamuza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe yeye wakankonka ne, Muana wa muntu, wakumona muanda eu, anyi? Neumone malu makuabo a bundu mahite â bubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakalua nʼanyi mu tshiendelu tshia munda mua nsubu wa Yehowa; ekumona! Ku tshibi tshia ku ntempelo wa Yehowa, hankatshi ha mbalanda ne tshioshelu, kuakadi balume bu makumi abidi ne batanu bimane ne nyima yabo miele ku ntempelo wa Yehowa ne mpala yabo mitangishe ku luseke lua ku esete; bakadi batendelela diba ku luseke lua esete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku yeye wakankonka ne, Muana wa muntu, wakumona muanda eu, anyi? Mbualu bukese ku mesu kua ba mu tshisamba tshia Bena Yuda bua kuenzabo malu a bundu adibo benza mu muaba eu, anyi? Bua meji abo a nunku badi busha buloba tente ne ditomboka diabo, ne batshidi bankuatshisha tshiji. Tangila mudibo bateka ditamba ku mûlu abo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku nengenze malu anyi ne tshiji tshikole. Disu dianyi kadiena dibatangila ne dinanga, tshiena mbafuila luse; nansha biadilabo ne di dikole mu matshu anyi, tshiena mbunvuila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
